    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: When on and no scripted run is active, the cell whose pad the ball is
        on becomes the registered arena (one at a time, because the motor's tables
        are global). The ball is not moved. Off = only the first cell registers until
        a run starts.
